            "text": "<p>Kiwi Cru’s wineries unite tradition and innovation - featuring New Zealand’s most respected and forward-thinking producers. These sustainably focused estates craft expressive, site-driven wines using both time-honoured methods and bold new techniques. From Marlborough to Central Otago, they produce expressive Pinot Noir, Chardonnay, Sauvignon Blanc, and more, with creativity, and a deep connection to people, place, and provenance.</p>",
